WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Hey! Hello there!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.309
Haven’t seen you in ages!

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:12.309
Oh… all right yeah.

00:00:12.309 --> 00:00:13.309
Great to see you again!

00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:14.380
You’re looking really well!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.380
Oh, you think so?

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.000
Thanks...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.500
So, how are you?

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.200
Well, you know, mustn’t grumble.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.200
What’ve you been up to?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.400
Still working in that coffee shop?

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.200
Yeah...same one...

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.800
Still trying to be an actor?

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.130
Well, yeah, you know...

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.120
So Hollywood hasn’t called then yet?

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.500
Not yet...

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.529
Still living in…that …er…little flat?

00:00:31.529 --> 00:00:32.529
Yeah, same one.

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:34.000
Well, great.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:34.800
How about you?

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.529
You still … working in that fast food place?

00:00:36.529 --> 00:00:37.029
No!

00:00:37.029 --> 00:00:38.400
Stopped that a long time ago!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.960
I’m working in the city now, financial industries!

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:41.960
Oh great.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.900
Are you still sharing that house with all
those other people?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:45.610
No way!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:49.910
I bought a big house with four bedrooms and
a garden, the works.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.400
Hmm…good for you.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.000
Listen!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.500
We should get together for a drink sometime,

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.200
catch up!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.200
Yeah, I’d love to.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:55.800
Let’s do it!

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.600
Keep in touch, hey?

